--[[
    Solanix Hub — All-in-One Script Hub for Roblox
    -----------------------------------------------
    Architecture:
      • Bootstrap (game-loaded check, executor compat, identity probe)
      • Services & Locals
      • Theme (mirrors Solanix.html CSS :root tokens)
      • Utilities (Create, Tween, Notify, SafeGetService, ValueToString)
      • UI Primitives (Section, Toggle, Button, Slider, TextBox, Dropdown, Scroller, TabBar)
      • Main Shell (Sidebar + Content + Floating Toggle + Notifications)
      • Modules:
          Home, Player, Visuals, Server, Scripts, Playerlist, Music, Settings,
          RemoteSpy (full SimpleSpy functionality),
          Explorer  (full Dex++ functionality — tree, properties, search, script viewer)
      • Hotkeys system
      • Settings persistence (writefile/readfile)
      • Shutdown function (cleanup all connections & instances)

    Everything lives inside a single ScreenGui in CoreGui/gethui.
    No loadstring, no external dependencies, fully self-contained.
]]

