--=====================================================================

--[[
    Solanix Hub UI Conventions
    ==========================

    Color Usage
    -----------
    - THEME.bgBase       : root window background
    - THEME.bgPanel      : cards, sections
    - THEME.bgSidebar    : sidebar, toolbars
    - THEME.bgEditor     : code inputs, dark text areas
    - THEME.bgElevated   : rows, inputs (raised above bgPanel)
    - THEME.bgHover      : hover state
    - THEME.bgActive     : active/selected state, secondary buttons

    - THEME.accent       : primary CTAs, focused inputs, indicators
    - THEME.accentDim    : secondary accent fills (sliders, etc.)
    - THEME.cyan         : secondary accent (data, paths)
    - THEME.green        : success, "ON" state
    - THEME.red          : error, "OFF" state, danger
    - THEME.amber        : warning, intermediate state

    - THEME.textPrimary  : main text color
    - THEME.textSecondary: secondary labels, descriptions
    - THEME.textMuted    : placeholder, disabled
    - THEME.textAccent   : highlighted text (active tab, headings)

    Spacing
    -------
    - Page padding: 14px on all sides
    - Section padding: 14px horizontal, 12px vertical
    - Section gap: 8px between sections
    - Row height: 26-32px (depends on content)
    - Button height: 32px default, 24px small, 20px tiny

    Radius
    ------
    - THEME.radius (8px) : cards, sections, large buttons
    - THEME.radiusSm (4px): rows, inputs, small buttons
    - THEME.radiusLg (12px): main window, dialogs
    - UDim.new(1, 0) for fully rounded (pills, switches)

    Borders
    -------
    - 1px UIStroke with THEME.borderLight for most surfaces
    - THEME.border for inner dividers
    - THEME.borderMid for hover state borders

    Typography
    ----------
    - THEME.font (GothamMedium)  : body text, labels
    - THEME.fontBold (GothamBold): headers, titles, button text
    - THEME.fontMono (Code)      : code, paths, hex values
    - 10-13px for body, 14-22px for titles

    Animations
    ----------
    - All tweens use TweenInfo.new(0.15, Quad, Out) by default
    - Hover transitions: 0.15s
    - Page transitions: 0.2s
    - Notification slides: 0.25s
    - Modal fade-ins: 0.3s

    Layout Patterns
    ---------------
    - VStack: vertical stack with gap
    - HStack: horizontal row with gap
    - Grid: UIGridLayout for button grids
    - Sidebar + Content: 200px sidebar + flexible content
    - Left/Right split: variable-width panels with divider

    Interaction Patterns
    --------------------
    - Click: MouseButton1Click on buttons
    - Hover: MouseEnter/MouseLeave with Tween
    - Right-click: MouseButton2Click for context menus
    - Drag: InputBegan/InputChanged/InputEnded
    - Multiselect: Ctrl+Click to toggle, Shift+Click for range
    - Search: FocusLost on TextBox triggers filter

    Accessibility
    -------------
    - Every interactive element has a hover state
    - Every interactive element has a clear focus indicator
    - Color is never the only differentiator (text labels too)
    - Tooltips are provided for icon-only buttons

    Performance
    -----------
    - UIListLayout for most lists (cheap, GPU-friendly)
    - Avoid GetDescendants in render loops
    - Use CanvasSize + AutomaticCanvasSize for scrolling frames
    - Disconnect connections on element destroy
]]

