    Solanix Hub — Complete Reference
    ================================

    This is the comprehensive inline reference for every aspect of
    Solanix Hub. It serves as both developer documentation and end-user
    help text. Use the Console module to query individual sections, or
    read through it sequentially to understand the entire system.

