    1. Introduction
    ---------------
    Solanix Hub is an all-in-one Roblox script hub. It combines the
    best features of three industry-standard tools — Sirius (hub
    architecture), Dex++ (instance explorer), and SimpleSpy (remote
    spy) — under a unified visual style derived from Solanix.html.

    The script is fully self-contained: no loadstring, no external
    HTTP fetches (except the optional server-hop API), no module
    imports. Everything lives in one ScreenGui inside CoreGui/gethui.

    2. Architecture
    ---------------
    The script is structured into clearly delimited sections:

    - Bootstrap: waits for game load, shuts down previous instances
    - Executor Compatibility Layer: wraps every optional executor API
      in graceful fallbacks
    - Services & Locals: caches Roblox service references
    - Theme: mirrors Solanix.html :root CSS variables
    - Utilities: Create, Track, Tween, Notify, ValueToString, etc.
    - UI Primitives: Section, Toggle, Button, Slider, TextBox,
      Dropdown, Scroller, TabBar, Label, Separator, NumberStepper,
      Keybind, ColorPicker, TreeView, Console
    - Main Shell: ScreenGui, Sidebar, Content, Floating Toggle
    - Modules: Home, Player, Visuals, RemoteSpy, Explorer, Server,
      Scripts, Playerlist, Music, Settings, Notebook, Console,
      Performance, Help, About, Keybinds, ThemeSettings,
      AdvancedSettings, UserGuide, SnippetBrowser, Tutorial,
      ThemePresets, Counter, Stopwatch, Calculator, RandomGen,
      ColorPlayground, TimeDisplay, PersistentCounter, FPSGraph,
      StringTools, BaseConverter, QuickActions,
      CharacterCustomization, AnimationPlayer, CameraTools,
      WorldTools, TimeOfDay, AudioRecorder, PropertyWatcher,
      InventoryInspector, PlayerStats, Teleportation, ChatHistory,
      ExecutorInfo, ScriptObserver, RemoteBlockManager, GameStats,
      ExtendedSettings, SessionInfo, AdvancedPlayerTools, AFKFarmer,
      InstanceScanner, AttributeManager, History, DataExport,
      ConnectionInspector, ExploreByID, KeyboardShortcuts,
      TeamManager, MarketplaceBrowser, LuaSandbox,
      BatchRemoteExecutor, ColorPalette, ScreenshotTool,
      ServerTimeTracker, KeyLogger, RemoteNotes, GUIInspector,
      SoundBrowser, TextureBrowser, CloneTool, PartCreator,
      EffectSandbox, GameInfoDump, ServerList, CharacterRespawner,
      GravityToggle, Watermark, AutoCollector, AntiAFKDetailed,
      FlyModes, ServerLagMeter, QuickProfiles, EventMonitor,
